# No AI slop (this repo)

- UI strings in `prompt/ui.html`: Indonesian, ≤1 short sentence per helper; no filler English.
- Docs: one idea per bullet; link paths that exist in repo.
- Do not add dependencies or submodules to “install everything” from awesome lists.
- Use skill `anti-slop-edits` when rewriting user-facing text.
- Figma plugin code: no `import (` in comments/strings (SES); see `npm run figma:check`.
